        "goal_understanding": "The goal is to navigate the grid through every level, modify the carried piece so its shape, color, and rotation match each goal cell, then step onto the matching goal to activate and complete it. All goals in a level must be completed to advance, and all levels must be won.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs one stamina, and reaching zero stamina costs a life before restoring stamina. Walls block movement, so the blocked_directions list must be checked before every move and blocked directions must never be attempted. Shape modifiers cycle shapes 0\u20135, color modifiers cycle colors orange \u2192 blue \u2192 green \u2192 red \u2192 orange, and rotation modifiers turn the piece 90\u00b0 clockwise. A goal only activates when all three piece attributes match its requirements, and the player must physically step onto it to complete it."
